# tally 2.2.1 R20 clause 2 (OPERATIONS §2.3): check prints each refused scenario's line in the full-path order of the
# files that declare them (one declared twice, by its first), then each ask refused alone by id, then full path, then
# line.
# P12: twin declared in p12/b and p12/d is placed by b/, before c/'s alpha. tally 2.2 placed it by d/ (T's held
# fixture/reviews/twin-placed).
=== options check exit=1
=== model.tally
model plain
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T's base for M3's check fixtures (invented): it loads clean with no warning; each fixture of fixtures.tsv adds files to it"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN = amt + amt at reader

ask q: doubled law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
=== p12/b/t1.tally
scenario twin over plain
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
=== p12/c/lost.tally
scenario alpha over nowhere
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
=== p12/d/t2.tally
scenario twin over plain
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
=== expect
scenario twin: refused: LOAD-SCENARIO scenario twin declared twice (p12/d/t2.tally:1)
scenario alpha: refused: LOAD-SCENARIO scenario alpha is over nowhere, neither the model nor a scenario (p12/c/lost.tally:1)
